<% article = @article_creation || %{} %>I have collected everything for the new draft:

- Title: <%= ExBlogWeb.Prompt.escape_text(Map.get(article, :title), 160) %>
- Category: <%= ExBlogWeb.Prompt.escape_text(Map.get(article, :category), 80) %>
- Language: <%= ExBlogWeb.Prompt.escape_text(Map.get(article, :lang), 32) %>
- Brief: <%= ExBlogWeb.Prompt.escape_text(Map.get(article, :brief), 1_000) %>
- Article: generated with OpenRouter (deep model)
- SEO and tags: <%= if Map.get(article, :generate_seo) do %>generated with OpenRouter<% else %>not requested<% end %>
- Cover: <%= ExBlogWeb.Prompt.escape_text(Map.get(article, :cover) || "none", 512) %>

Reply “yes” to generate and save the article, or “no” to cancel.
